Here is a complete HTML and CSS landing page for a futuristic coffee shop:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Neon Brew - Futuristic Coffee Shop</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; background: #0a0a0a; color: #e0e0e0; min-height: 100vh; }
        .container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        header { text-align: center; padding: 60px 0 40px; }
        header h1 { font-size: 3.5em; background: linear-gradient(45deg, #ff00ff, #00ffff); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; }
        header p { color: #888; font-size: 1.2em; margin-top: 10px; letter-spacing: 3px; }
        nav { text-align: center; padding: 20px 0; border-top: 1px solid #333; border-bottom: 1px solid #333; }
        nav a { color: #00ffff; text-decoration: none; margin: 0 20px; font-size: 1.1em; transition: color 0.3s; }
        nav a:hover { color: #ff00ff; }
        .hero { text-align: center; padding: 80px 0; background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #1a0033 0%, #0a0a0a 70%); }
        .hero h2 { font-size: 2.5em; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .hero p { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 30px; line-height: 1.8; color: #aaa; }
        .cta { display: inline-block; padding: 15px 40px; background: linear-gradient(45deg, #ff00ff, #00ffff); color: #000; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 30px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.1em; }
        .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; padding: 60px 0; }
        .card { background: #111; border: 1px solid #333; border-radius: 10px; padding: 30px; text-align: center; transition: all 0.3s; }
        .card:hover { border-color: #ff00ff; transform: translateY(-5px); box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255,0,255,0.2); }
        .card h3 { color: #00ffff; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .card .price { color: #ff00ff; font-size: 1.5em; margin: 15px 0; }
        .card p { color: #888; line-height: 1.5; }
        footer { text-align: center; padding: 30px; color: #555; border-top: 1px solid #333; }
        @media (max-width: 768px) { header h1 { font-size: 2em; } .hero h2 { font-size: 1.8em; } .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>Neon Brew</h1>
        <p>FUTURE OF COFFEE</p>
    </header>
    <nav>
        <a href="#">Menu</a>
        <a href="#">About</a>
        <a href="#">Location</a>
        <a href="#">Contact</a>
    </nav>
    <section class="hero">
        <h2>Welcome to the Future</h2>
        <p>Experience coffee like never before. Our robotic baristas craft each cup with precision using sustainably sourced beans from orbital farms.</p>
        <a href="#" class="cta">Explore Our Menu</a>
    </section>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="grid">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Quantum Brew</h3>
                <div class="price">$6.99</div>
                <p>Single-origin Ethiopian beans, cold-brewed with nitrogen infusion</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Cyber Latte</h3>
                <div class="price">$5.99</div>
                <p>Matcha latte with activated charcoal and gold leaf</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Neon Espresso</h3>
                <div class="price">$4.99</div>
                <p>Double espresso with a hint of vanilla and edible glitter</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <footer><p>&copy; 2025 Neon Brew. All rights reserved.</p></footer>
</body>
</html>
```
